  "sexColumnCandidates": ["Sex", "Gender"],
  "sexValues": {
    "male": ["male", "m", "1"],
    "female": ["female", "f", "0"]
  },
  "notes": [
    "Review-only mapping scaffold. Do not mark generated output as vetted until source licensing and field protocols are approved.",
    "ANSUR-style source columns are commonly millimeters for linear anthropometry and kilograms for weight; confirm against the downloaded codebook before use.",
    "Some app fields intentionally remain unmapped because no direct source column is configured yet."
